 ow the Malvern Buzzards Running Club is doing.Any questions will be answere
 d and after the business of the meeting we have a presentation on nutrition
  which I am sure you will all find very useful.After that we can continue t
 o socialise while the bar stays open until 21:30.Please click in if you sha
 ll be attending.If you are unable to attend\, I shall be sending out inform
 ation and proxy votes w/c 12th January.View on Strava: https://www.strava.c
 om/clubs/208705/group_events/3444400174910285946Synced from Strava Club 208
